WEBVTT

00:15.270 --> 00:18.460
To think the princess of a kingdom...

00:18.760 --> 00:20.010
Uncle!

00:21.380 --> 00:25.670
...would venture into the battlefield,
still in her gown...

00:25.670 --> 00:28.130
Th-That's...

00:29.530 --> 00:32.700
I really think your automatic regeneration
is a bad influence.

00:32.700 --> 00:35.520
It makes you arrogant and lenient.

00:36.240 --> 00:37.690
That's not...

00:39.780 --> 00:44.020
I hear you haven't got any rest
since the battle started.

00:44.610 --> 00:46.380
Why not get some now?

00:47.490 --> 00:48.610
But...

00:50.220 --> 00:51.400
Good grief.

00:51.800 --> 00:54.280
Then, at least try not to make me
worry so much.

00:56.080 --> 01:00.140
Also, when going to battle,
you must make sure to change your outfit.

01:00.140 --> 01:01.830
Okay, Uncle.

01:03.100 --> 01:05.270
We must report to His Majesty too.

01:05.270 --> 01:07.090
Let's go back to the castle for now,

01:07.540 --> 01:08.500
Aletia.

01:08.500 --> 01:12.920
Okay! In that case, I would like
to have your cooking again!

01:26.940 --> 01:32.410
ARIFURETA - FROM COMMONPLACE
TO WORLD'S STRONGEST SEASON 3

02:44.020 --> 02:49.020
THE OVERPOWERED VAMPIRE PRINCESS
AND THE GODLIKE RABBIT'S GRAND BATTLE

02:56.020 --> 02:59.700
I showed you a hallucination of your past,
but you're quite resilient indeed.

03:00.310 --> 03:02.660
I don't like the way you speak.

03:03.100 --> 03:06.150
But this is how you speak, Aletia.

03:06.150 --> 03:07.940
Don't call me that!

03:07.940 --> 03:09.380
No, thank you.

03:09.790 --> 03:11.380
You're pissing me off...

03:16.670 --> 03:20.220
Do not forget that I am you.

03:22.910 --> 03:26.440
There is no such thing
as trust in this world.

03:26.790 --> 03:31.860
The fact that Uncle, whom I trusted so much,
betrayed me, is proof.

03:33.460 --> 03:36.380
I kept fighting and fighting and fighting...

03:36.380 --> 03:38.700
Serving my country...

03:43.990 --> 03:45.370
So, about His Majesty...

03:46.370 --> 03:49.960
I suppose it is safe to assume
we can leave it to him to deal with it?

03:49.960 --> 03:51.790
Yes, indeed.

03:52.090 --> 03:55.190
Understood.
I'll be on my way, then.

03:56.760 --> 03:57.880
Uncle!

03:57.880 --> 03:58.780
Yes?

03:59.540 --> 04:01.050
Um...

04:02.520 --> 04:04.940
Why don't we have dinner
together after so long?

04:04.940 --> 04:07.560
I would like your opinion as well.

04:07.930 --> 04:09.810
Is that an order?

04:10.450 --> 04:13.120
Huh? No, it's not exactly...

04:13.900 --> 04:18.280
Then, pardon me,
but I would like to excuse myself now.

04:18.760 --> 04:21.690
I must take care of something.

04:21.690 --> 04:23.600
Is that so...

04:23.600 --> 04:25.160
Yes. Farewell.

04:31.400 --> 04:34.030
My beloved daughter.

04:34.030 --> 04:36.260
I suppose you are at your limits now.

04:36.760 --> 04:39.180
Make your choice as the ruler.

04:39.680 --> 04:41.740
For that is an ambitious one,

04:41.740 --> 04:44.720
thinking you stole away the throne.

04:45.160 --> 04:47.100
Utterly dangerous.

04:51.720 --> 04:52.900
Who goes there?!

04:59.600 --> 05:01.060
Uncle...

05:04.070 --> 05:05.460
Why...

05:06.700 --> 05:10.120
Uncle did not utter a single word.

05:10.560 --> 05:11.790
Is that not right?

05:15.690 --> 05:17.360
You really are annoying!

05:19.160 --> 05:21.130
I trusted him!

05:22.350 --> 05:25.480
But I was betrayed...
I was double-crossed by him!

05:28.280 --> 05:33.020
Despite the trust I put on him...
Despite the bonds we forged together!

05:37.400 --> 05:41.360
People betray each other
for their own ambitions.

05:42.450 --> 05:45.920
That includes your most beloved ones,
your precious friends!

05:45.920 --> 05:48.290
All of them will betray you!

05:50.200 --> 05:52.620
Pulverise the dark past!

05:54.500 --> 05:56.870
I guess you still have not fallen yet.

05:56.870 --> 06:00.300
Although, I sort of figured it out
because I am weakening now.

06:00.300 --> 06:02.300
Of course.

06:02.300 --> 06:04.470
Miss Yue is a beloved character!

06:05.000 --> 06:07.910
Still, my power is only weakening
by a slim percentage.

06:08.350 --> 06:10.240
That is proof...

06:10.240 --> 06:13.800
...that you have not been
relieved of the betrayal.

06:13.800 --> 06:14.900
Of course.

06:15.240 --> 06:18.820
To me, the betrayal
is something dear to me.

06:18.820 --> 06:20.230
What...?

06:20.840 --> 06:24.000
I mean, had Uncle not betrayed me,

06:24.000 --> 06:26.970
had I not been sealed in the abyss...

06:26.970 --> 06:28.410
I...

06:29.080 --> 06:33.290
If by not having such past
I wouldn't get to meet him...

06:33.290 --> 06:36.200
Even if I had to relive the past,

06:36.200 --> 06:39.340
I'd choose the same path every time.

06:39.600 --> 06:43.010
I'd choose the same suffering every time.

06:45.560 --> 06:47.770
Such a bold statement...

06:48.150 --> 06:49.970
I guess you are alike.

06:50.840 --> 06:52.580
Time to end this.

06:55.350 --> 06:56.700
I get it now.

06:56.700 --> 06:58.960
To you, Hajime Nagumo...

06:58.960 --> 07:01.540
...is what makes all of you, eh?

07:06.790 --> 07:08.980
Averting your eyes from the contradictions,

07:09.520 --> 07:13.000
you never think of what you should be.

07:13.000 --> 07:14.350
What are you...

07:14.350 --> 07:16.920
Do you really think you can stay...

07:17.240 --> 07:19.220
...with him forever and ever?

07:20.380 --> 07:21.300
I'll have my way!

07:29.170 --> 07:30.370
Too fast!

07:30.940 --> 07:32.140
Too slow!

07:33.470 --> 07:36.290
It's all because you were born.

07:36.750 --> 07:39.810
Your family had to live in hiding.

07:39.810 --> 07:43.610
Even the other rabbitmen
gave them a cold shoulder.

07:44.040 --> 07:47.850
I'm all alone in this vast sea of trees!

07:47.850 --> 07:50.780
Even my family are different from me!

07:50.780 --> 07:52.630
I could've just run away!

07:52.630 --> 07:55.160
I could've stayed away from them!

07:55.160 --> 07:58.310
Then they didn't have to die!

07:58.310 --> 08:00.680
It's all because I was weak!

08:00.680 --> 08:02.710
Because my body and mind were weak!

08:08.240 --> 08:10.850
How irritating, yes!

08:23.360 --> 08:25.570
I give up.

08:25.920 --> 08:27.970
So you're at your limits already?

08:27.970 --> 08:31.320
Seems like your limits are still far away...

08:31.320 --> 08:34.510
You really don't waver at all...

08:34.510 --> 08:37.880
Although, this is supposed to
be the dark emotion I bear...

08:39.270 --> 08:41.150
You can't change the past.

08:41.150 --> 08:43.110
You can only carry it with you.

08:43.110 --> 08:48.010
Even so, didn't we promise
to work hard for the future?

08:49.320 --> 08:53.040
We'll face all trying
to rob us of those precious to us,

08:53.040 --> 08:55.200
and become someone who can protect all.

08:55.980 --> 09:00.100
Didn't we vow to become such person?

09:01.690 --> 09:03.570
Let me be clear now.

09:03.570 --> 09:05.630
I am invincible now!

09:05.630 --> 09:08.490
I won't lose to anyone now!

09:08.490 --> 09:12.690
I see... This trial is meant for you
to overcome yourself...

09:13.140 --> 09:15.910
But it seems like
you've cleared it already.

09:15.910 --> 09:17.900
Exactly!

09:17.900 --> 09:21.070
My precious friends and family
are waiting for me,

09:21.070 --> 09:22.960
so I must push through!

09:24.150 --> 09:25.190
Very well.

09:25.560 --> 09:28.350
Give it all you've got for the final blow.

09:28.350 --> 09:30.530
Here I go!

09:33.270 --> 09:36.480
Why did Uncle not kill you?

09:37.540 --> 09:39.100
You should know why.

09:39.610 --> 09:42.100
Your immortality is not absolute.

09:42.100 --> 09:44.770
No way you are unkillable.

09:44.770 --> 09:46.260
That man...

09:46.260 --> 09:50.190
He didn't mean to kill me
from the beginning?

09:50.190 --> 09:53.610
Indeed.
It was his goal to seal you.

09:53.610 --> 09:54.870
So...

09:55.290 --> 09:59.560
There was a reason to seal me...

10:06.610 --> 10:09.850
Who are you? What am I?

10:11.170 --> 10:14.980
You never think of what you should be.

10:16.840 --> 10:21.350
Do you really think you can stay
with him forever and ever?

10:22.020 --> 10:25.810
I remembered it wrong...

10:27.270 --> 10:29.020
But why...

10:34.450 --> 10:36.860
Even so, I won't be alone.

10:37.310 --> 10:38.410
No, you...

10:38.410 --> 10:41.720
Shea and Tio are also next to him.

10:41.720 --> 10:43.880
While I hate to admit it, Kaori too.

10:47.300 --> 10:52.610
No matter where you are, the centre of
your world will be Hajime Nagumo, eh?

10:52.610 --> 10:53.800
Of course.

10:53.800 --> 10:56.390
You really are alike...

10:56.390 --> 10:58.900
There's no use soliloquising any further.

10:58.900 --> 10:59.710
Indeed.

11:05.270 --> 11:09.490
At the very least, if I lose here,
I won't be able to see Hajime again!

11:09.490 --> 11:11.070
Don't get in my way!

11:32.280 --> 11:33.630
Miss Yue!

11:34.760 --> 11:36.050
Did something happen?

11:36.510 --> 11:37.820
It's nothing.

11:37.820 --> 11:39.020
I cleared the trial.

11:39.020 --> 11:40.330
Really?

11:40.940 --> 11:42.720
I won by a long shot!

11:44.440 --> 11:45.180
Shea?

11:45.180 --> 11:47.350
Yes? Need something?

11:48.570 --> 11:51.410
If something happens to me...

11:52.090 --> 11:53.280
I'm leaving Hajime to you.

11:57.560 --> 11:59.260
Are you kidding?

11:59.260 --> 12:00.120
Huh?

12:00.660 --> 12:03.800
I'm not! I already made up my mind!

12:04.630 --> 12:06.040
Made up your mind?

12:14.400 --> 12:15.380
Shea?

12:16.360 --> 12:18.080
Take it back.

12:19.270 --> 12:24.250
Take back what you said about
leaving Mister Hajime to me!

12:25.100 --> 12:28.080
Are you saying my trust to you is a joke?!

12:28.080 --> 12:30.100
How else do you want me to put it?!

12:30.670 --> 12:33.980
I don't know what the impostor said to you,

12:33.980 --> 12:35.970
but you've gone soft now!

12:36.520 --> 12:39.640
What a sad sight
for the invincible vampire princess!

12:39.640 --> 12:43.510
I'll fix that cowardice for you!

12:43.830 --> 12:45.120
Wait, Shea!

12:50.600 --> 12:52.840
Shea, this is too much as a prank.

12:52.840 --> 12:58.070
A prank? How can you still say
such a cowardly thing now?

12:58.070 --> 12:59.630
Let me be clear.

13:00.100 --> 13:01.280
I'm dead serious.

13:02.040 --> 13:03.930
Why, Shea?

13:03.930 --> 13:06.810
I can't stand you, that's why!

13:07.160 --> 13:10.480
The usual you...
The Miss Yue I know...

13:11.200 --> 13:13.900
She wouldn't say something like that!

13:13.900 --> 13:15.660
Cut it out already!

13:15.660 --> 13:18.320
Don't you know how much
I was prepared to say that?!

13:24.070 --> 13:25.780
You call that...

13:26.120 --> 13:28.860
...being prepared, of all things, yes?!

13:33.170 --> 13:34.710
Stop already!

13:34.710 --> 13:36.870
I should be saying that!

13:36.870 --> 13:40.090
Have you come to regret it
and take it all back?

13:40.500 --> 13:41.720
Why?!

13:41.720 --> 13:45.140
Why?! You really don't know?!

13:54.270 --> 13:56.270
If you leave him to me,

13:56.650 --> 14:01.950
that means you'll be gone in the future!

14:03.500 --> 14:04.490
Shea...

14:07.440 --> 14:10.180
Such future...

14:10.180 --> 14:12.760
Do you really think
I'll approve it?!

14:12.760 --> 14:15.540
Do you really think
I'll just say yes to it?!

14:16.740 --> 14:19.460
I just want to prepare for the worst...

14:19.460 --> 14:22.610
Like hell I care!

14:31.640 --> 14:35.270
You promised,
but you couldn't protect Hajime.

14:37.420 --> 14:42.200
You were utterly jealous of Yue.
You were enveloped with inferiority.

14:42.980 --> 14:45.470
Why am I not special?

14:45.470 --> 14:47.950
Why am I so weak?

14:48.230 --> 14:51.280
Even though I abandoned my precious
vessel to gain more power...

14:51.280 --> 14:53.020
Why does it have to be Shea?!

14:53.020 --> 14:56.490
Why?! That was supposed to be my place!

14:57.210 --> 15:00.130
I was the one who loved him most!

15:00.130 --> 15:03.800
Don't take my precious one away from me!

15:14.080 --> 15:15.850
Your speed has gone up again.

15:22.070 --> 15:26.900
Your jealousy, your frustration,
your impatience, your inferiority complex...

15:26.900 --> 15:28.740
It all hasn't disappeared yet!

15:29.310 --> 15:33.650
Right now, you are hurt
and suffering within!

15:33.650 --> 15:35.910
Even so, I can still grow!

15:42.380 --> 15:43.300
Thunderburst!

15:45.290 --> 15:47.010
Remote activation?

15:49.910 --> 15:52.350
My enhancement... has stopped?

15:52.710 --> 15:56.050
I really am so full of myself, huh...

15:56.050 --> 16:00.310
Even at school, and when I parted ways
with Shizuku and the others...

16:00.310 --> 16:03.670
Right. You're beyond help already.

16:03.670 --> 16:06.370
You really are self-centered,

16:06.370 --> 16:08.740
far from being an ideal person!

16:16.370 --> 16:18.070
I want to change.

16:18.070 --> 16:22.620
I want to be as kind as Yue,
as strong as Shea,

16:22.620 --> 16:27.300
as cunning as Tio,
as cute as Shizuku.

16:27.300 --> 16:28.630
I see...

16:29.150 --> 16:33.630
If your negative emotions still remain
despite my being weakened now...

16:33.630 --> 16:37.600
It's because you are
moving forward at this moment.

16:37.600 --> 16:39.670
I was jealous of Shea.

16:39.670 --> 16:43.400
But... at the same time,
I was happy about her.

16:43.400 --> 16:45.550
I really hate Yue!

16:45.550 --> 16:48.900
But then again,
I'd feel lonely without her!

16:49.260 --> 16:51.870
And I could notice Shizuku's feelings, too!

16:54.350 --> 16:56.760
I'm afraid of my hideous side.

16:56.760 --> 16:59.250
But I won't look away anymore!

16:59.600 --> 17:03.260
I won't lose to anyone,
especially myself!

17:03.260 --> 17:05.170
I'll protect everyone,

17:05.170 --> 17:07.840
and go back together to Japan!

17:18.040 --> 17:20.370
I guess nothing will get through you anymore.

17:21.070 --> 17:23.570
My enhancement has already worn off now.

17:23.900 --> 17:26.300
Here comes my last strike.

17:26.300 --> 17:29.010
Fine, come at me with all you've got.

17:29.010 --> 17:32.200
Cut away one of your weaknesses.

17:43.530 --> 17:44.380
Huh?

17:44.960 --> 17:46.920
Huh? What was that?

17:49.260 --> 17:52.560
Let me remind you, Miss Yue.

17:54.810 --> 17:57.390
What true determination is!

17:59.750 --> 18:03.230
Um, Yue, Shea, what's happening...

18:03.230 --> 18:05.880
Shea, listen to me!
I had the wrong memory...

18:05.880 --> 18:07.720
Shut up, yes!

18:07.720 --> 18:11.300
The special person Mister Hajime
fell for wouldn't give up!

18:11.300 --> 18:14.740
What do you mean "if something
happens to me", you coward?!

18:15.200 --> 18:18.470
There was another reason
for my being sealed!

18:18.470 --> 18:21.080
As if I care, yes!

18:21.080 --> 18:25.090
If it's hostile,
we kill it and push forward!

18:25.090 --> 18:26.920
Isn't that what makes us who we are?!

18:26.920 --> 18:29.880
Yet you're saying you're
prepared for a "what-if"?!

18:29.880 --> 18:33.560
Ugh, you clumsy vampire!

18:33.560 --> 18:38.010
Eternal midget! Flat chest!

18:38.010 --> 18:41.580
Midget? Flat chest?

18:45.920 --> 18:48.340
Now you've crossed the line!

18:49.200 --> 18:52.380
You'd better take that back now,
you sad rabbit!

18:52.380 --> 18:56.050
That's my line, you eternal midget!

18:56.050 --> 19:00.410
I'll turn you into a roasted rabbit
to show the difference in our skills.

19:00.410 --> 19:04.440
Heh! As if you can pull that off,
you coward flat chest!

19:04.440 --> 19:06.750
Time to show you who's boss now!

19:24.940 --> 19:26.270
Right...

19:26.870 --> 19:28.870
They two are close, after all...

19:29.570 --> 19:32.550
I really am no good...

19:32.550 --> 19:35.590
Huh? My power is rising again?

19:36.050 --> 19:39.130
Hey, get a grip now!

19:39.130 --> 19:42.060
I really am good for nothing...

19:42.060 --> 19:46.000
No, you're not! Believe me!

19:46.000 --> 19:48.570
Repent now, yes!

19:48.570 --> 19:50.960
You eternally horny vampire!

19:51.400 --> 19:54.550
That's rich, coming from a nympho rabbit!

19:54.550 --> 19:56.250
Who are you calling a nympho?!

19:56.250 --> 19:59.180
You're the one who'd assault him
anywhere you want!

19:59.180 --> 20:00.720
You pervert!

20:02.630 --> 20:05.810
I'm not Tio, you pants wetter rabbit!

20:05.810 --> 20:07.600
I'll make you wet your pants again!

20:08.360 --> 20:13.530
I guess living for three centuries does turn you
into a wicked old hag, yes?!

20:13.530 --> 20:15.530
I'll kill you! You're dead now!

20:15.530 --> 20:18.180
I'll show you how deadly
gravitational magic is!

20:18.180 --> 20:20.950
Weep over those sagging boobs!

20:39.070 --> 20:41.750
Don't say such sad thing.

20:42.320 --> 20:46.400
If you have worries,
let's resolve it together.

20:47.210 --> 20:50.820
Don't pass it on to me,
involve me in it!

20:50.820 --> 20:54.650
Say that you want to
fight with me for the future!

20:54.650 --> 20:56.950
I won't accept that!

20:56.950 --> 21:02.520
I definitely won't accept
such a foolish request...

21:11.190 --> 21:12.310
Shea.

21:15.420 --> 21:16.710
I'm sorry.

21:17.710 --> 21:18.880
Miss Yue?

21:19.290 --> 21:21.220
It's just as you said.

21:21.220 --> 21:25.050
No matter my past,
no matter who I am...

21:25.050 --> 21:26.920
It doesn't matter.

21:28.070 --> 21:32.010
I want to be with you and Hajime forever.

21:34.540 --> 21:39.240
So, no matter who stands in our way,
we'll send them flying.

21:39.650 --> 21:41.490
That's all there is to it.

21:41.490 --> 21:45.200
You're right...

21:49.780 --> 21:51.570
Hey, you two.

21:52.920 --> 21:56.000
You turned the trial venue into a mess...

21:56.490 --> 21:59.180
Can you really call this clearing the trial?

23:32.970 --> 23:34.830
WHAT MAKES A HERO

23:34.830 --> 23:37.790
WHAT MAKES A HERO
Next episode: What Makes a Hero.

23:37.790 --> 23:40.840
WHAT MAKES A HERO
